WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.601
Well, let me ask you this,

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:02.235
because right now

00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:03.703
we're showing some live pictures

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:05.238
of what's taking place in Brazil

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:06.439
right now.

00:00:06.639 --> 00:00:07.007
As you

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:08.141
know, and we've been reporting

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:10.043
all afternoon here on CNN pro

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:12.045
Bolsonaro supporters as supporters

00:00:12.379 --> 00:00:14.514
of the former president Jair Bolsonaro

00:00:14.781 --> 00:00:15.682
have stormed into

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:17.717
various government buildings

00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:19.052
in that country's capital.

00:00:19.052 --> 00:00:22.255
It looks like a replay of January six,

00:00:22.422 --> 00:00:24.591
this time in Brazil.

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:27.794
As you know, Congressman,

00:00:27.794 --> 00:00:29.763
you just have to look at the scenes

00:00:29.763 --> 00:00:31.598
on our on our screens right now.

00:00:31.598 --> 00:00:32.132
We've been playing

00:00:32.132 --> 00:00:33.433
some of these screens earlier

00:00:33.433 --> 00:00:34.200
or some of these images.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.101
Earlier today,

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:35.935
one of these pro

00:00:35.935 --> 00:00:36.903
Bolsonaro supporters

00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:40.540
was sitting at a desk inside the capitol

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:43.209
in Brasilia in Brazil,

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:44.277
and it looked like a scene

00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:45.478
right out of January six.

00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:46.146
What are your thoughts

00:00:46.146 --> 00:00:47.714
as this is taking place today?

00:00:49.349 --> 00:00:49.649
Well,

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:52.452
Bolsonaro was an authoritarian leader,

00:00:52.752 --> 00:00:53.753
and I stand

00:00:53.753 --> 00:00:54.821
with the democratically

00:00:54.821 --> 00:00:57.090
elected leadership in Brazil.

00:00:57.090 --> 00:01:00.060
And he basically used the Trump playbook

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:01.895
to inspire domestic terrorists

00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:03.897
to try to take over the government.

00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:04.564
And you're right,

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:06.099
it looks a lot like January six

00:01:06.099 --> 00:01:07.434
in the United States.

00:01:07.434 --> 00:01:08.435
And right now,

00:01:08.435 --> 00:01:09.969
Bolsonaro is in Florida,

00:01:09.969 --> 00:01:11.504
and he's actually very close to

00:01:11.504 --> 00:01:12.639
Donald Trump.

00:01:12.639 --> 00:01:14.674
He should be extradited to Brazil.

00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:15.842
In fact,

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:16.643
it was reported

00:01:16.643 --> 00:01:17.911
that he was under investigation

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:18.978
for corruption

00:01:18.978 --> 00:01:21.281
and fled Brazil to the United States.

00:01:21.481 --> 00:01:22.782
He's a dangerous man.

00:01:22.782 --> 00:01:23.983
They should send him back to his home

00:01:23.983 --> 00:01:25.418
country, Brazil.

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:27.187
And so if I'm gathering

00:01:27.187 --> 00:01:28.088
what you're saying, Congressman,

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:29.456
are you calling on the

00:01:29.456 --> 00:01:30.790
Biden administration

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:33.827
or authorities in Florida to return

00:01:33.827 --> 00:01:35.061
Bolsonaro, put them on a plane

00:01:35.061 --> 00:01:36.996
and send them to Brazil

00:01:36.996 --> 00:01:38.631
as soon as possible? Absolutely.

00:01:39.866 --> 00:01:41.701
Bolsonaro should not be in Florida.

00:01:41.701 --> 00:01:42.669
This the United States

00:01:42.669 --> 00:01:43.837
should not be a refuge

00:01:43.837 --> 00:01:45.572
for this authoritarian

00:01:45.572 --> 00:01:46.239
who has inspired

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:47.907
domestic terrorism in Brazil.

00:01:47.907 --> 00:01:49.242
He should be sent back to Brazil.

